            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#fbbf24;min-width:60px">C</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Minor flare. Rare HF impact on very long sunlit paths.</span></li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#fb923c;min-width:60px">M</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Moderate. Brief short-wave fadeout possible. Monitor.</span></li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#f87171;min-width:60px">X</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Major. HF blackout on sunlit side. May last 1+ hour.</span></li>
