            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#fbbf24;min-width:60px">G1–G2</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Kp 5–6. Minor to moderate. Watch polar paths.</span></li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#fb923c;min-width:60px">G3</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Kp 7. Strong. HF degraded broadly. Aurora to 50°N.</span></li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:var(--mono);color:#f87171;min-width:60px">G4–G5</span><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem">Kp 8–9. Severe to extreme. Near-total HF blackout.</span></li>
